#: temp.glade:460 temp.glade:2883
msgid "MAT MRK LUK JHN ACT ROM 1CO 2CO GAL EPH PHP COL 1TH 2TH 1TI 2TI TIT"
msgstr "太 可 路 约 使 罗 林前 林后 加 弗 腓 西 帖前 帖后 提前 提后 多"

#: temp.glade:472
msgid "Add Syllable-Based Hyphenated Words"
msgstr "添加基于音节的连字符词"

#: temp.glade:510
msgid "Limit Hyphenation List to Words Found in:"
msgstr "将连字符词表限于在以下书卷中找到的词："

#: temp.glade:515
msgid "Normally ALL hyphenated words from ALL books\n"
"are included in PTXprint's hyphenated wordlist.\n"
"\n"
"However, if the list of hyphenated words is too long\n"
"(greater than 63929 words) then you can prioritize\n"
"which words to include by enabling this option to\n"
"only use words from the books being printed.\n"
"\n"
"Note that if there are too many words in the Paratext\n"
"hyphenation file, PTXprint will automatically prioritize\n"
"the list created for XeTeX based on frequency."
msgstr "通常情况下，所有书卷中的所有连字符词\n"
"都会包括在 PTXprint 的连字符词表中。\n"
"\n"
"然而，如果连字符词表太长\n"
"（超过 63929 个词），可以启用此选项来确定优先收录哪些词，\n"
"使词表只包含正在打印的书卷中的连字符词。\n"
"\n"
"注意，如果 Paratext\n"
"连字符文件中的词过多，PTXprint 会自动按词频优先\n"
"为 XeTeX 创建词表。"

#: temp.glade:536
msgid "Only Use Approved Hyphenation Words"
msgstr "仅使用已批准的连字符词"

#: temp.glade:541
msgid "The Paratext WordList tool guesses hyphenation points\n"
"based on syllable structure and patterns in the language.\n"
"\n"
"However, it expects the user to (i) check and, if appropriate,\n"
"(ii) approve the suggested hyphenation points (by clicking\n"
"the check mark making it appear green).\n"
"\n"
"Normally only the approved hyphenated words will be used\n"
"when creating the hyphenation list for PTXprint/TeX to use.\n"
"\n"
"However, if you wish to include ALL words (regardless of\n"
"their approval status) then disable this option."
msgstr "Paratext 词表工具会根据语言的音节结构和模式推测连字符位置。\n"
"\n"
"不过，需要用户 (i) 检查，并在合适时\n"
"(ii) 批准建议的连字符位置（单击\n"
"使复选标记显示为绿色）。\n"
"\n"
"通常情况下，在创建供 PTXprint/TeX 使用的连字符词表时，\n"
"只使用已批准的连字符词。\n"
"\n"
"但是，如果要包含所有词（无论\n"
"其批准状态如何），请禁用此选项。"

#: temp.glade:583
msgid "Minimum affix:"
msgstr "最小词缀长度："

#: temp.glade:612 temp.glade:628
msgid "The minimum word length (including \n"
"optional hyphens) that will be added\n"
"to the hyphenation list."
msgstr "将添加到断字列表的单词的最小长度\n"
"（包括可选连字符）。"

#: temp.glade:617
msgid "Minimum length:"
msgstr "最小长度："

#: temp.glade:644 temp.glade:657
msgid "Minimum word length for a word\n"
"to block hyphenation."
msgstr "单词阻止断字所需的最小长度。"

#: temp.glade:646
msgid "Min non-hyphen:"
msgstr "最小非连字符长度："

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:3011 temp.glade:674 temp.glade:35767
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "高级"

#: temp.glade:695
msgid "When Creating Hyphenation List"
msgstr "创建连字符词表时"

#: temp.glade:1238
msgid "PTXprint: Add Tatweel (kashida) Rules"
msgstr "PTXprint：添加Tatweel（kashida）规则"

#: temp.glade:1321 temp.glade:1340
msgid "Enter the verse reference\n"
"where the word is located.\n"
"\n"
"(Note that the reference is\n"
"automatically updated from\n"
"the current Paratext reference.)"
msgstr "输入单词所在节的引用。\n"
"\n"
"（注意：引用会自动根据\n"
"Paratext 当前引用更新。）"

#: temp.glade:1329
msgid "JHN 3:16"
msgstr "JHN 3:16"

#: temp.glade:1348 temp.glade:5013
msgid "Reference:"
msgstr "引用："

#: temp.glade:1363 temp.glade:1385
msgid "Enter the word to be lengthened\n"
"and place the cursor at the location\n"
"and use shortcut Ctrl-` (Ctrl-grave) \n"
"to insert Tatweels. Repeat at other \n"
"words and/or locations.\n"
"\n"
"(Note that this box is automatically\n"
"updated from the clipboard if the\n"
"word/phrase is 60 characters or less)."
msgstr "输入要拉长的单词，\n"
"将光标放在相应位置，\n"
"使用快捷键 Ctrl-`（Ctrl-grave）\n"
"插入拉长线。可在其他\n"
"单词或位置重复此操作。\n"
"\n"
"（注意：如果剪贴板中的单词/短语\n"
"不超过 60 个字符，此框会自动更新。）"

#: temp.glade:1374
msgid "text from clipboard"
msgstr "来自剪贴板的文本"

#: temp.glade:1396
msgid "Word / Phrase:"
msgstr "词/短语："

#: temp.glade:1408
msgid "How many Tatweels should\n"
"be inserted at the current\n"
"cursor location?\n"
msgstr "当前光标位置应\n"
"插入多少个拉长线？\n"

#: temp.glade:1414
msgid "Tatweels to insert:"
msgstr "要插入的拉长线："

#: temp.glade:1431
msgid "3"
msgstr "3"

#: temp.glade:1447
msgid "The rule to be added to Changes.txt"
msgstr "要添加到 Changes.txt 的规则"

#: temp.glade:1629
msgid "PTXprint: Import Scripture..."
msgstr "PTXprint：导入经文..."

#: temp.glade:1702 temp.glade:1727
msgid "The Berean Standard Bible is\n"
"a Public Domain English Bible.\n"
"It is bundled with PTXprint but\n"
"needs to be installed in your\n"
"Projects folder.\n"
"\n"
"This is a good training project\n"
"and can also be used in diglots."
msgstr "Berean Standard Bible 是一本\n"
"公有领域的英文圣经。\n"
"它随 PTXprint 一起提供，\n"
"但需要安装到项目文件夹中。\n"
"\n"
"这是一个很好的培训项目，\n"
"也可用于双语对照排版。"

#: temp.glade:1711
msgid "Install Sample Text:\n"
"Berean Standard Bible"
msgstr "安装示例文本：\n"
"Berean Standard Bible"

#: temp.glade:1723
msgid "Install BSB"
msgstr "安装 BSB"

#: temp.glade:1776
msgid " OR "
msgstr "或"

#: temp.glade:1819 temp.glade:14868
msgid "Locate..."
msgstr "定位..."

#: temp.glade:1824 temp.glade:1842
msgid "After downloading a scripture text bundle \n"
"(.zip) file you need to tell PTXprint where \n"
"the .zip file is located so that it can install\n"
"it as a special resource project."
msgstr "下载经文文本包（.zip 文件）后，需要告知 PTXprint 该 .zip 文件所在的位置，以便将其作为特殊资源项目安装。"

#: temp.glade:1848
msgid "<b>Step 2</b>\n"
"Locate File:"
msgstr "<b>第 2 步</b>\n"
"定位文件："

#: temp.glade:1868
msgid "<b>Step 3</b>\n"
"Assign a Name\n"
"for the Project:"
msgstr "<b>第 3 步</b>\n"
"为项目指定\n"
"名称："

#: temp.glade:1936 temp.glade:28654
msgid "Filename:"
msgstr "文件名："

#: temp.glade:1949
msgid "Primary DBL site"
msgstr "DBL主站点"

#: temp.glade:1955
msgid "There are hundreds of Scripture bundles available\n"
"at the Digital Bible Library website which you may\n"
"download and use in a publication. You must log in\n"
"to the site in order to access resources.\n"
"\n"
"Use resources which contain the text\n"
"(not just the audio) and preferably\n"
"select the USX download option.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: If this option is disabled, it is\n"
"due to the \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"option which has been set on the\n"
"General section of the Advanced tab.</span>"
msgstr "Digital Bible Library 网站上有数百个经文文本包，\n"
"可下载并用于出版物。需要登录该网站\n"
"才能访问资源。\n"
"\n"
"请使用包含文本（而不仅是音频）的资源，\n"
"并优先选择 USX 下载选项。\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">注意：如果此选项被禁用，\n"
"是因为在“高级”选项卡的“常规”部分\n"
"设置了“禁用所有互联网使用”选项。</span>"

#: temp.glade:1982
msgid "If you don't already have a Scripture Text Bundle, \n"
"then you can download a USX or USFM text\n"
"bundle from an online scripture repository."
msgstr "如果还没有经文文本包，可以从在线经文库下载 USX 或 USFM 文本包。"

#: temp.glade:1987
msgid "<b>Step 1</b>\n"
"Download a Scripture\n"
"Text Bundle from an\n"
"Online Repository"
msgstr "<b>第 1 步</b>\n"
"从在线经文库\n"
"下载经文文本包"

#: temp.glade:2005 temp.glade:5025 temp.glade:16383
msgid "Description:"
msgstr "描述："

#: temp.glade:2018
msgid "Open.Bible site"
msgstr "Open.Bible网站"

#: temp.glade:2024
msgid "There are hundreds of Scripture bundles\n"
"at the Open.Bible website which you may\n"
"download and use in a publication.\n"
"\n"
"Use resources which contain the text\n"
"(not just the audio) and preferably\n"
"select the USX download option.\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">Note: If this option is disabled, it is\n"
"due to the \"Disable ALL Internet Use\"\n"
"option which has been set on the\n"
"General section of the Advanced tab.</span>"
msgstr "Open.Bible 网站上有数百个经文文本包，\n"
"可下载并用于出版物。\n"
"\n"
"请使用包含文本（而不仅是音频）的资源，\n"
"并优先选择 USX 下载选项。\n"
"\n"
"<span fgcolor=\"#FFFF00\">注意：如果此选项被禁用，\n"
"是因为在“高级”选项卡的“常规”部分\n"
"设置了“禁用所有互联网使用”选项。</span>"

#: lib/ptxprint/gtkpolyglot.py:1113 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4797 lib/ptxprint/gtkview.py:4822 temp.glade:2055 temp.glade:2280
msgid "Do not use spaces or special characters"
msgstr "请勿使用空格或特殊字符"

#: temp.glade:2099
msgid "PTXprint is built with Python & PyGTK3, using Glade for\n"
"the user-interface. The PDFs are produced by enhanced \n"
"XeTeX macros (ptx2pdf) with a long and reliable history."
msgstr "PTXprint 使用 Python 和 PyGTK3 构建，并使用 Glade\n"
"设计用户界面。PDF 文件由增强的\n"
"XeTeX 宏（ptx2pdf）生成，该宏历史悠久，性能可靠。"

#: temp.glade:2103
msgid "PTXprint Homepage"
msgstr "PTXprint主页"

#: temp.glade:2143
msgid "PTXprint: Save Current Configuration As..."
msgstr "PTXprint：将当前配置另存为..."

#: temp.glade:2224 temp.glade:2246 temp.glade:3995 temp.glade:4018
msgid "Enter a name for the configuration to be saved.\n"
"\n"
"Note that only Roman/Latin names\n"
"are supported using: a-z A-Z, 0-9,\n"
"parentheses, underscores and hyphens.\n"
"Spaces are not permitted."
msgstr "输入要保存的配置名称。\n"
"\n"
"请注意，仅支持罗马/拉丁文名称，\n"
"可使用：a-z A-Z、0-9、\n"
"圆括号、下划线和连字符。\n"
"不允许使用空格。"

#: temp.glade:2230
msgid "Configuration Name:"
msgstr "配置名称："

#: temp.glade:2308 temp.glade:2353
msgid "PTXprint: Please Confirm..."
msgstr "PTXprint：请确认..."

#: temp.glade:2313
msgid "You are about to REMOVE this Configuration"
msgstr "即将删除此配置"

#: temp.glade:2314
msgid "Are you sure you want to DELETE it?"
msgstr "确定要删除吗？"

#: temp.glade:2318 temp.glade:17154
msgid "Delete this Saved Configuration\n"
"\n"
"This also deletes the corresponding subfolder \n"
"of temporary files in the local\\ptxprint folder \n"
"but does not delete the previously created \n"
"PDF files which will remain in that folder."
msgstr "删除此已保存的配置\n"
"\n"
"同时会删除local\\ptxprint文件夹中\n"
"临时文件的对应子文件夹，\n"
"但不会删除之前生成的\n"
"PDF文件，这些文件仍保留在该文件夹中。"

#: temp.glade:2358
msgid "You are about to CREATE a diglot (or polyglot) configuration. This setting cannot be undone."
msgstr "即将创建双语对照（或多语对照）配置。此设置无法撤销。"

#: temp.glade:2359
msgid "Consider using the <b>Save As...</b> button to create a NEW Configuration Layout before proceeding to enable the Diglot. <b>Are you sure you want to CONTINUE?</b>"
msgstr "建议先使用<b>另存为...</b>按钮创建新的配置布局，再启用双语对照。<b>确定要继续吗？</b>"

#: temp.glade:2364
msgid "Unlike most other PTXprint settings (which can easily be\n"
"toggled on or off), the Diglot setting is special in that it\n"
"has to set up a number of other settings; and is very hard\n"
"to disable later. So only continue if you are sure that this\n"
"is what you need to do.\n"
"\n"
"It is highly recommended to first save the existing\n"
"configuration with a new name (like \"Diglot\") and\n"
"then proceed with the step of enabling this option.\n"
msgstr "与大多数其他 PTXprint 设置（可以轻松开启或关闭）不同，双语对照设置比较特殊：它需要设置许多其他选项，而且之后很难禁用。因此，只有确定需要这样做时才继续。\n"
"\n"
"强烈建议先用新名称（如“双语对照”）保存现有配置，然后再执行启用此选项的步骤。\n"

#: temp.glade:2409
msgid "PTXprint: Generate Front Matter"
msgstr "PTXprint：生成文前辅文"

#: temp.glade:2494
msgid "BASIC: Front matter contains just a few\n"
"essentials with publication information"
msgstr "基本：文前辅文只包含一些有关出版信息的\n"
"基本内容"

#: temp.glade:2500
msgid "This option will create a simple verso page\n"
"containing essential copyright and licensing\n"
"information followed by a table of contents."
msgstr "此选项将创建一个简单的左页（反面页），\n"
"包含基本的版权和许可\n"
"信息，然后是目录。"

#: temp.glade:2518
msgid "ADVANCED: template contains several sections\n"
"(some of which require editing before use)"
msgstr "高级：模板包含多个部分\n"
"（其中一些部分需在使用前编辑）"

#: temp.glade:2524
msgid "This option will create an extensive template\n"
"with multiple sections (each of which will start\n"
"on a new page in the final publication). You will\n"
"need to edit the sample text provided so that it\n"
"communicates in the required language(s).\n"
"You can also remove unwanted sections if they\n"
"are inappropriate for this publication.\n"
"Note: In order to make this template generic for\n"
"several different publications in this project, you\n"
"are encouraged to use \\zvar|variables\\*  which will be\n"
"replaced with publication-specific info when printed.\n"
"For example:\n"
"\\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"\\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|subtitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|languagename\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|copiesprinted\\*"
msgstr "此选项将创建一个内容丰富的模板，\n"
"包含多个部分（在最终出版物中，每个部分都会从新页面开始）。\n"
"需要编辑所提供的示例文本，以便\n"
"使用所需的语言表达。\n"
"如果某些部分不适合本出版物，\n"
"也可以删除。\n"
"注意：为使此模板能通用于本项目中的\n"
"多种不同出版物，建议使用 \\zvar|variables\\*，\n"
"打印时将被替换为\n"
"各出版物的专属信息。\n"
"例如：\n"
"\\mt1 \\zvar|maintitle\\*\n"
"\\mt2 \\zvar|subtitle\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|maintitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|subtitlefr\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|languagename\\*\n"
"\\pc \\zvar|copiesprinted\\*"

#: temp.glade:2556
msgid "Include sections for a separate cover page"
msgstr "包含单独封面页所需的部分"

#: temp.glade:2561
msgid "(Not yet implemented)\n"
"Enable this option if you want to include the following\n"
"sections (used for creating a cover page):\n"
"\\periph Cover - detailing text and optional picture\n"
"\\periph Spine - text for the spine of the cover"
msgstr "（尚未实现）\n"
"如果要包含以下部分\n"
"（用于创建封面页），请启用此选项：\n"
"\\periph Cover - 说明文字和可选图片\n"
"\\periph Spine - 封面书脊上的文字"

#: temp.glade:2597 temp.glade:2970
msgid "Warning!"
msgstr "警告！"

#: temp.glade:2612
msgid "This operation can overwrite\n"
"carefully crafted settings.\n"
"So choose carefully...\n"
"If in doubt, click Cancel."
msgstr "此操作会覆盖 \n"
"精心打造的设置。\n"
"所以要谨慎选择......\n"
"如有疑问，点击取消。"

#: temp.glade:2627
msgid "DIGLOT: template for a Diglot or Polyglot publication\n"
"(deliberately fuller — delete sections you do not need)"
msgstr "双语对照：双语或多语对照出版物的模板\n"
"（内容刻意更完整——请删除不需要的部分）"

#: temp.glade:2633
msgid "This option creates a DIGLOT / POLYGLOT front matter\n"
"template designed for publications with two (or more)\n"
"languages or scripts. It is deliberately more complete\n"
"than the BASIC and ADVANCED templates because diglots\n"
"are inherently complex: two (or more) texts, often two\n"
"contents lists, two prefaces, sometimes two scripts and\n"
"two writing directions. Delete the sections you do not need.\n"
"\n"
"Like the ADVANCED template it uses \\zvar|variables\\* and\n"
"\\zglot|L\\* / \\zglot|R\\* markers for column-specific content,\n"
"so it requires editing before use and is NOT suitable for\n"
"use inside Paratext without prior modification.\n"
"\n"
"If this option is disabled, the Diglot setting is not\n"
"enabled for this configuration."
msgstr "此选项创建双语对照/多语对照文前辅文模板，适用于包含两种（或更多）语言或文字的出版物。该模板刻意比基本和高级模板更完整，因为双语对照本身就很复杂：有两种（或更多）文本，常有两个目录、两篇序言，有时还有两种文字和两种书写方向。请删除不需要的部分。\n"
"\n"
"与高级模板一样，该模板使用 \\zvar|variables\\* 以及 \\zglot|L\\* / \\zglot|R\\* 标记来表示分栏专用内容，因此使用前需要编辑，未经修改不适合在 Paratext 中使用。\n"
"\n"
"如果此选项被禁用，则此配置未启用双语对照设置。"

#: temp.glade:2662
msgid "PARATEXT: Make a copy of the Project's FRT book\n"
"(which may be edited to make use of \\zvar|variables\\*)"
msgstr "《圣经辅助工具》: 制作一个项目的 FRT 书 \n"
"(可以编辑以使用\\zvar|变量\\*)"

#: temp.glade:2668
msgid "This option will create a COPY of the Paratext project's\n"
"FRT book to be used exclusively by PTXprint. You can\n"
"edit the front matter to make use of PTXprint-specific\n"
"\\zvar|variables\\* but note that none of these edits will\n"
"be reflected in Paratext. In addition, if you edit the FRT\n"
"book in Paratext, those changes will not be reflected\n"
"here until you regenerate this (local) Front Matter.\n"
"\n"
"If option is disabled, it is due to not having a FRT book\n"
"in the Paratext project (so there is nothing to import)."
msgstr "此选项将创建 Paratext 项目 FRT 卷的副本，专供 PTXprint 使用。可以编辑文前辅文，以使用 PTXprint 特有的 \\zvar|variables\\*，但这些编辑不会反映到 Paratext 中。此外，如果在 Paratext 中编辑 FRT 卷，这些更改在重新生成此（本地）文前辅文之前不会反映到这里。\n"
"\n"
"如果此选项被禁用，是因为 Paratext 项目中没有 FRT 卷（因此没有可导入的内容）。"

#: temp.glade:2719
msgid "Generate Front Matter"
msgstr "生成文前辅文"

#: temp.glade:2740
msgid "PTXprint: Generate PicList"
msgstr "PTXprint：生成图片列表"

