#: temp.glade:15199
msgid "Adjustments "
msgstr "调整"

#: temp.glade:15203
msgid "Show color-coded lines on the left \n"
"and right edges of paragraphs to\n"
"indicate the kind of shrink or\n"
"stretch that has been applied as well\n"
"as the amount (thickness of line).\n"
"\n"
"These ajustment annotations are not\n"
"part of the PDF, but are only overlaid\n"
"on the text to help refine the layout.\n"
"\n"
"Key:\n"
"\n"
"Left=shrink       Right=expand\n"
"\n"
"blue=shrink/expand lines\n"
"red=shrink/expand text\n"
"\n"
"Interleaved red+blue indicates\n"
"that both lines and words have\n"
"been stretched/expanded."
msgstr "在段落的左、右边缘显示颜色编码的线条，以\n"
"指示已应用的收缩或扩展类型以及数量（线条厚度）。\n"
"\n"
"这些调整注释不是PDF的一部分，而是仅\n"
"在文本上覆盖以帮助细化布局。\n"
"\n"
"图例：\n"
"\n"
"左=收缩 右=扩展\n"
"\n"
"蓝色=收缩/扩展线\n"
"红色=收缩/扩展文本\n"
"\n"
"红色+蓝色交错\n"
"表示行和单词均已\n"
"收缩/扩展。"

