#: temp.glade:2629
msgid "Generate front matter: DIGLOT (for Diglot/Polyglot publications)"
msgstr "生成前置页：双语对照（用于双语对照/多语对照出版物）"

#: temp.glade:26331
msgid "Center page header settings"
msgstr "居中页眉设置"

#: temp.glade:26334
msgid "The header line on each page can contain the page number, \n"
"and/or reference(s) in various forms. Select a preset option,\n"
"or type in a keyword with additional adornments as needed. \n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\\bookalt\\ \\rangeref   uses the book name from the \\h1 alt book header\n"
"[\\pagenumber]    places square brackets around the page number\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins    gives \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     places nothing in that location\n"
"\n"
"Note that a space and the following certain special \n"
"characters require a slash '\\' to be typed before them:\n"
"    # % & ^ ~ and \\ itself.\n"
"For example, to get this output: \n"
"     This is page #1\n"
"you would need to enter:\n"
"     This\\ is\\ page\\ \\#\\pagenumber"
msgstr "每个页面上的页眉行可以包含页码和/或各种形式的经文引用。\n"
"选择预设选项，或输入关键词并按需添加修饰。\n"
"\n"
"例如：\n"
"\\bookalt\\ \\rangeref   使用 \\h1 备用卷标题中的卷名\n"
"[\\pagenumber]    在页码两侧加方括号\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins    得到“DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM”\n"
"-empty-     在该位置不放置任何内容\n"
"\n"
"注意：空格以及下列特殊字符前需要先输入反斜杠“\\”：\n"
"    # % & ^ ~ 以及 \\ 本身。\n"
"例如，要得到如下输出：\n"
"     This is page #1\n"
"需要输入：\n"
"     This\\ is\\ page\\ \\#\\pagenumber"

#: temp.glade:26382
msgid "Outer (right) page header settings"
msgstr "外（右）页页眉设置"

#: temp.glade:26385 temp.glade:26436
msgid "The header line on each page can contain the page number, \n"
"and/or reference(s) in various forms. Select a preset option,\n"
"or type in a keyword with additional adornments as needed. \n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"\\bookalt\\ \\rangeref   uses the book name from the \\h1 alt book header\n"
"[\\pagenumber]    places square brackets around the page number\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins    gives \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-YY HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     places nothing in that location\n"
"\n"
"Note that a space and the following certain special \n"
"characters require a slash '\\' to be typed before them:\n"
"    # % & ^ ~ and \\ itself.\n"
"For example, to get this output: \n"
"     This is page #1\n"
"you would need to enter:\n"
"     This\\ is\\ page\\ \\#\\pagenumber"
msgstr "每个页面上的页眉行可以包含页码和/或各种形式的经文引用。\n"
"选择预设选项，或输入关键词并按需添加修饰。\n"
"\n"
"例如：\n"
"\\bookalt\\ \\rangeref   使用 \\h1 备用卷标题中的卷名\n"
"[\\pagenumber]    在页码两侧加方括号\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins    得到“DRAFT YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM”\n"
"-empty-     在该位置不放置任何内容\n"
"\n"
"注意：空格以及下列特殊字符前需要先输入反斜杠“\\”：\n"
"    # % & ^ ~ 以及 \\ 本身。\n"
"例如，要得到如下输出：\n"
"     This is page #1\n"
"需要输入：\n"
"     This\\ is\\ page\\ \\#\\pagenumber"

#: temp.glade:26433
msgid "Inner (left) page header settings"
msgstr "内页（左侧）页眉设置"

#: temp.glade:26468
msgid "Date (YYY-MM-DD)"
msgstr "日期（YYY-MM-DD）"

#: temp.glade:26469
msgid "Printed on YYY-MM-DD"
msgstr "印刷日期：YYY-MM-DD"

#: temp.glade:26488
msgid "Use formatting from primary project (inner header)"
msgstr "使用主要项目的格式（内侧页眉）"

#: temp.glade:26492 temp.glade:26519 temp.glade:26546 temp.glade:26573 temp.glade:26600 temp.glade:26627
msgid "If setting the header for a diglot\n"
"you will need to specify whether\n"
"the Primary (Left) text's formatting\n"
"should be used for this part of the\n"
"header, or the Secondary format.\n"
"\n"
"Note: To activate or change this \n"
"setting, you must first enable Diglot."
msgstr "为双语对照设置页眉时，\n"
"需要指定页眉的这一部分\n"
"使用主要（左）文本的格式，\n"
"还是次要文本的格式。\n"
"\n"
"注意：要激活或更改此设置，\n"
"必须先启用双语对照。"

#: temp.glade:26515
msgid "Use formatting from secondary project (inner header)"
msgstr "使用次要项目的格式（内侧页眉）"

#: temp.glade:26542
msgid "Use formatting from primary project (center header)"
msgstr "使用主要项目的格式（居中页眉）"

#: temp.glade:26569 temp.glade:26623
msgid "Use formatting from primary project (outer header)"
msgstr "使用主要项目的格式（外侧页眉）"

#: temp.glade:26596
msgid "Use formatting from secondary project (center header)"
msgstr "使用次要项目的格式（居中页眉）"

#: temp.glade:2664
msgid "Generate front matter: PARATEXT (make a local copy)"
msgstr "生成文前辅文：Paratext（制作本地副本）"

#: temp.glade:26694
msgid "By default, the chapter number will be included\n"
"in any references in the header line. If you prefer\n"
"to suppress that (and just show the book name)\n"
"then uncheck this option."
msgstr "默认情况下，页眉行的引用中会包含章号。\n"
"如果只想显示卷名，\n"
"请取消选中此选项。"

#: temp.glade:26911 temp.glade:26937
msgid "If the document you are creating needs\n"
"to be appended to another, you can\n"
"start the page numbering from where\n"
"the previous document ends by entering\n"
"the subsequent page number here.\n"
"\n"
"If you want front matter pages to be numbered \n"
"with roman numerals (i, ii, iii, iv, v, etc) then \n"
"add this line to the front matter to trigger it:\n"
"       \\resetpagenums -1\n"
"and normal page numbering will restart as\n"
"soon as the first scripture book is encountered."
msgstr "如果所创建的文件需要\n"
"附加到另一个文件之后，可以在此输入\n"
"后续页码，使页码从前一个文件\n"
"结束的位置接续编排。\n"
"\n"
"如果希望文前辅文页使用罗马数字\n"
"（i、ii、iii、iv、v 等）编号，\n"
"请在文前辅文中添加下面这一行：\n"
"       \\resetpagenums -1\n"
"遇到第一卷经文后，将重新开始正常的页码编排。"

#: temp.glade:26934
msgid "Start numbering scripture books from page N"
msgstr "从第N页开始为经文各卷编排页码"

#: temp.glade:26970
msgid "Print page number at each book's Intro page footer"
msgstr "在每卷序言页的页脚打印页码"

#: temp.glade:26974
msgid "By default there is no page number on the\n"
"Title Page of each book. Check this option\n"
"to place the page number at the bottom of\n"
"the page (only on Intoductory Pages before \n"
"the scripture text begins)."
msgstr "默认情况下，每卷的标题页\n"
"上没有页码。勾选此选项\n"
"可将页码放在页面底部\n"
"（仅限经文开始之前的序言页）。"

#: temp.glade:26992
msgid "Print the name of the config on Intro pages' footer"
msgstr "在序言页面的页脚打印配置名称"

#: temp.glade:26996
msgid "It may be helpful to print the Name of\n"
"the Saved Configuration on the first\n"
"page (of every book) as a reminder for\n"
"later - as to which settings were used\n"
"to produce the PDF."
msgstr "在（每卷的）第一页\n"
"打印已保存的配置名称，方便日后查看制作PDF时\n"
"使用了哪些设置。"

#: temp.glade:27059
msgid "Center page footer settings"
msgstr "居中页脚设置"

#: temp.glade:27063
msgid "It is not considered best-practice to include \n"
"information in a footer for scripture publications.\n"
"This is usually better placed in the header. However,\n"
"if there is a need to have the page number at the\n"
"footer for all pages (not just the 1st page of each book)\n"
"then that can be set here. Similarly, you may want to add\n"
"a DRAFT message and/or date to the end of each page.\n"
"Note that you can select a preset option OR type your own\n"
"text as needed.\n"
"\n"
"For example:\n"
"[\\pagenumber]   places square brackets around the page number\n"
"DRAFT\\ \\isodate\\ \\hrsmins   would give \"DRAFT YYYY-MM-YY HH:MM\"\n"
"-empty-     places nothing in that location\n"
"\n"
"Note that if you really must have Inner/Outer Footers,\n"
"these can be set in the ptxprint-mods.tex file."
msgstr "在经文出版物的页脚中放置信息\n"
"并不是最佳做法。\n"
"这些信息通常更适合放在页眉。然而，\n"
"如果所有页面都需要在\n"
